{"id": "EUVD-2026-76316", "enisaUuid": "54891783-8f79-39ab-916d-d3f22d78b593", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet: phylink: correctly validate returned PCS in phylink_inband_caps\n\nIn phylink_inband_caps(), the PCS returned by mac_select_pcs is only\nchecked if NULL but mac_select_pcs can also return an error pointer.\n\nThis can cause a kernel panic as phylink_pcs_inband_caps() only checks\nif passed PCS is not NULL and directly dereference ops from the phylink_pcs\nstruct.\n\nUse the IS_ERR_OR_NULL macro to address both case where the returned\nPCS can be NULL or an error pointer and prevent a kernel panic.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:42:49", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:46:17", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b6b533f83461c3730875cf3ed5ff6362dcb67be9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fb4d77553841ae85bed9b2cf03351c401e871d85", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f2849b1fd059ec9b3281b771e6ac5aad9feee851"], "aliases": ["GHSA-v77c-jw3g-56gh", "CVE-2026-80993"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2f434610-68d2-370c-82c7-643bd4a7d198", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "622074e7-06f7-3d18-8bd4-ee69b64d100b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "df874f9e52c340cc6f0a0014a97b778f67d46849 <fb4d77553841ae85bed9b2cf03351c401e871d85"}, {"id": "62e4d77f-9a62-3c4d-b261-8299cccf886e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "df874f9e52c340cc6f0a0014a97b778f67d46849 <b6b533f83461c3730875cf3ed5ff6362dcb67be9"}, {"id": "828c7c5e-6918-3f55-a930-19f73e980f08", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "9682a33a-2158-349e-99d7-26a5ce23428f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.14"}, {"id": "a655cff6-8dff-3678-9d6a-f23a7eba211e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "df874f9e52c340cc6f0a0014a97b778f67d46849 <f2849b1fd059ec9b3281b771e6ac5aad9feee851"}, {"id": "ce7bc4d4-e689-32ad-b4e0-27df34c5f333", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "eba53080-76ae-3be6-8205-3f68ee695360", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5396e06d-0133-3db8-bae9-4fc9947a4303", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}